WEBVTT

00:12:25.152 --> 00:12:30.586
The six-letter word is like a capsule
of accumulated hurt.

00:12:32.712 --> 00:12:35.374
Every time it is said, every time,

00:12:35.398 --> 00:12:38.934
it releases into the atmosphere
the hateful notion

00:12:38.958 --> 00:12:41.736
that black people are less.

00:12:43.942 --> 00:12:45.148
My black students tell me

00:12:45.172 --> 00:12:47.672
that when the word is quoted
or spoken in class,

00:12:47.696 --> 00:12:51.688
they feel like a giant spotlight
is shining on them.

00:12:53.037 --> 00:12:54.359
One of my students told me

00:12:54.359 --> 00:12:56.878
that his classmates
were like bobbleheads,

00:12:56.902 --> 00:12:58.902
turning to gauge his reaction.